| `ci_pipeline` | string | `github` | `github`, `gitlab`, `both` | copier `_exclude` and `_migrations` | Picks the CI adapters the project ships: `github` keeps `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `gitlab` keeps `.gitlab-ci.yml`, `both` keeps both. On update, the adapter the new answer declines is removed only when it is byte-equal to what keel last rendered; an edited one is kept and named on stderr. | what the adapters run: config/project.json `ci_pipeline.steps` | always |
